{
  "info": {
    "name": "Monitoring Pipeline (IDMS)",
    "description": "Collection API untuk modul Monitoring Pipeline — data inspeksi UT piping (API 574/570): data teknis pipa, data desain, hasil UT (actual thickness, corrosion rate, remaining life), dan status perawatan.\n\n**Base URL**\nDefault `{{baseUrl}}` = `http://localhost/idms_be/public` (Laragon). Kalau memakai `php artisan serve`, ganti ke `http://127.0.0.1:8000`.\n\n**Endpoint (8)**\n- `GET    /api/monitoring_pipeline` — list + search + filter + sort + paginate\n- `POST   /api/monitoring_pipeline` — create\n- `GET    /api/monitoring_pipeline/{id}` — detail\n- `PUT    /api/monitoring_pipeline/{id}` — update\n- `DELETE /api/monitoring_pipeline/{id}` — delete\n- `GET    /api/monitoring_pipeline/template` — download template xlsx\n- `POST   /api/monitoring_pipeline/import` — import xlsx/xls (upsert)\n- `GET    /api/monitoring_pipeline/export` — export xlsx (mengikuti filter aktif)\n\n**Peculiarities modul ini**\n- Semua endpoint butuh token (`auth:api`). Tanpa token → `401 {\"message\":\"Unauthenticated.\"}` (kirim header `Accept: application/json` supaya responsnya JSON, bukan halaman error HTML).\n- `tag_number_id` adalah FK **unik** → maksimal 1 baris monitoring per tag. Karena itu import bersifat **upsert** per tag: tag yang sudah ada di-update, yang baru di-insert.\n- Update **boleh parsial**: `tag_number_id` hanya divalidasi bila dikirim (`sometimes`). Kirim hanya kolom yang mau diubah.\n- Validasi tulis: `insulation` hanya `Yes`/`No`; `pipe_condition`, `maintenance_status`, `rencana_tindak_lanjut` maksimal 255 karakter; `sch` maks 50; `tml_drawing_number`/`grade_material` maks 150; semua tanggal harus format tanggal valid (`YYYY-MM-DD`).\n- Bentuk respons: index → `{success, message, data:[...], meta:{current_page, last_page, per_page, total}}`; show → `{data:{...}}`; store/update → `{success, message, data:{...}}` (store: 201); delete → `{success, message}`; error validasi → 422 `{success:false, message:\"Validation failed.\", errors:{...}}`.\n\n**Query param `index` (dan dipakai juga oleh `export`)**\n- `search` (LIKE, 7 kolom): tag number, TML drawing number, grade material, SCH, pipe condition, maintenance status, rencana tindak lanjut.\n- Filter sebagian (LIKE, case-insensitive): `insulation`, `grade_material`, `pipe_condition`, `maintenance_status` — mis. `grade_material=SA10` menemukan `SA106 GR B`, `SA106 GR A`, `SA210 GR A1`.\n- Filter persamaan (exact): `api_service_class`, `unit_id` (lewat `tag_numbers.unit_id`).\n- Filter rentang tanggal (inclusive): `tanggal_pasang_line_from/_to`, `tanggal_ut_terakhir_from/_to`, `next_plan_inspection_api_from/_to`. Catatan: nilai tanggal yang tidak valid tidak memicu 422 — hasilnya hanya kosong (0 baris).\n- `sort_by` (whitelist: id, tag_number, semua kolom data, created_at, updated_at) + `sort_order` asc|desc. Default `created_at desc`. Nilai di luar whitelist **tidak error** — jatuh ke default.\n- `per_page` default 10 (nilai tak terbaca → kembali ke 10).\n\n**Import (detail teknis)**\n- Format: `.xlsx` / `.xls`, maksimal 10 MB.\n- Sheet: `Database UT Piping` bila ada di workbook, kalau tidak → sheet pertama (file template juga bisa di-import).\n- Baris header ditemukan otomatis: baris pertama yang kolom B-nya mengandung `TAG NUMBER` (file asli header di baris 2, template di baris 1).\n- Kolom dipetakan dari **judul header** (di-slug-kan), bukan posisi kolom — urutan kolom boleh berubah. Sel formula dibaca dari cached value terakhir file disimpan di Excel.\n- Pencocokan tag **persis** dengan `tag_numbers.tag_number` (tanpa normalisasi suffix). Tag yang tidak ditemukan → `failed` + `errors[]`; tag yang dobel dalam 1 file → baris kedua dihitung `failed` (Duplikat Tag Number dalam file).\n- Re-import file yang sama = update (idempoten). Respons: `{success, message, summary:{total, success, failed, skipped, errors:[{row, tag_number, message}], warnings:[{row, column, value, message}], warnings_total}}`. `total` = jumlah baris ber-tag; baris kosong dihitung `skipped`.\n- Nilai tak terbaca (`-`, `N/A`, `#N/A`, insulation di luar Yes/No, dll) disimpan NULL dan dicatat ke `warnings[]`.\n\n**File contoh import**\n`docs/api/samples/monitoring_pipeline_import_sample.xlsx` berisi: 1 baris tag valid (`1-V-04/00`), 1 baris tag duplikat, 1 baris tag tak dikenal (`ZZ-NOT-EXIST-001`), 1 baris kosong. Postman menyimpan path file di komputer masing-masing — bila pindah mesin, klik kanan request → Body → pilih ulang filenya.\n\n**Urutan Collection Runner**\nLogin → List/Filter → Detail → CRUD (create, lalu delete) → Import & Export → Bersih-bersih (hapus baris uji + Logout). Semua request punya test script, jadi bisa langsung dijalankan berurutan tanpa meninggalkan data uji.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost/idms_be/public", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "monitoring_pipeline_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "created_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "imported_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tag_number_id", "value": "8", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tag_terpakai", "value": "4120", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tag_import", "value": "1-V-04/00", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autentikasi",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (ambil token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('sukses + token ada', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "login"]
            },
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "description": "Simpan JWT ke variabel collection `token` (dan environment `token`) lewat test script — request berikutnya otomatis memakainya."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tanpa token → 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('pesan Unauthenticated', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.eql('Unauthenticated.');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_pipeline?per_page=1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_pipeline"],
              "query": [{ "key": "per_page", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "description": "Membuktikan proteksi `auth:api`. Header `Accept: application/json` penting supaya respons 401 berupa JSON, bukan halaman error HTML."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. List & Filter",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List (per_page 25, simpan id pertama)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('punya data[] + meta', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "});",
                  "if (Array.isArray(json.data) && json.data.length) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('monitoring_pipeline_id', json.data[0].id);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('tag_terpakai', json.data[0].tag_number_id);",
                  "    console.log('monitoring_pipeline_id =', json.data[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_pipeline?per_page=25&sort_by=id&sort_order=asc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_pipeline"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "per_page", "value": "25" },
                { "key": "sort_by", "value": "id" },
                { "key": "sort_order", "value": "asc" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Variabel `monitoring_pipeline_id` terisi otomatis dari baris pertama — dipakai request Show di folder berikutnya."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (search tag number / material)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('hanya baris yang cocok', () => {",
                  "    const rows = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                  "    rows.forEach(r => {",
                  "        const s = [r.tag_number, r.tml_drawing_number, r.grade_material, r.sch, r.pipe_condition, r.maintenance_status, r.rencana_tindak_lanjut].join(' ');",
                  "        pm.expect(s.toLowerCase()).to.include('p434');",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_pipeline?search=P434&per_page=5",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_pipeline"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "search", "value": "P434" },
                { "key": "per_page", "value": "5" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`search` melakukan LIKE ke 7 kolom: tag number, TML drawing number, grade material, SCH, pipe condition, maintenance status, rencana tindak lanjut."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (filter insulation + unit_id + sort nps asc)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_pipeline?insulation=No&unit_id=1&sort_by=nps&sort_order=asc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_pipeline"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "insulation", "value": "No" },
                { "key": "unit_id", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "sort_by", "value": "nps" },
                { "key": "sort_order", "value": "asc" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Kombinasi filter: `insulation` dicocokkan sebagian (LIKE, jadi `insulation=NO` tetap menemukan `No`), `unit_id` persis (exact) lewat tabel `tag_numbers` (join)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (filter rentang tanggal UT terakhir)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_pipeline?tanggal_ut_terakhir_from=2025-01-01&tanggal_ut_terakhir_to=2025-12-31",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_pipeline"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "tanggal_ut_terakhir_from", "value": "2025-01-01" },
                { "key": "tanggal_ut_terakhir_to", "value": "2025-12-31" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rentang tanggal inclusive. Berlaku juga untuk `tanggal_pasang_line_from/_to` dan `next_plan_inspection_api_from/_to`. Nilai tanggal yang tidak valid tidak error — hanya menghasilkan 0 baris."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (filter pipe_condition + maintenance_status)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_pipeline?pipe_condition=GOOD%20CONDITION&maintenance_status=GOOD%20CONDITION",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_pipeline"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "pipe_condition", "value": "GOOD CONDITION" },
                { "key": "maintenance_status", "value": "GOOD CONDITION" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (filter partial: grade_material=SA10)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const rows = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                  "pm.test('semua grade_material mengandung SA10 (bukan harus sama persis)', () => {",
                  "    rows.forEach(r => pm.expect(String(r.grade_material).toLowerCase()).to.include('sa10'));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('ada baris yang nilainya bukan persis SA10', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(rows.some(r => String(r.grade_material).toUpperCase() !== 'SA10')).to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_pipeline?grade_material=SA10&per_page=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_pipeline"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "grade_material", "value": "SA10" },
                { "key": "per_page", "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filter sebagian (LIKE, case-insensitive): `SA10` menemukan `SA106 GR B`, `SA106 GR A`, `SA210 GR A1`, dan nilai lain yang mengandung `SA10`. Berlaku juga untuk `insulation`, `pipe_condition`, dan `maintenance_status`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List (sort_by di luar whitelist — aman, fallback)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200 (tidak error)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('jatuh ke default created_at desc', () => {",
                  "    const rows = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                  "    if (rows.length > 1) {",
                  "        const times = rows.map(r => r.created_at);",
                  "        const sorted = [...times].sort().reverse();",
                  "        pm.expect(times).to.eql(sorted);",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_pipeline?sort_by=dropme&sort_order=asc&per_page=5",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_pipeline"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "sort_by", "value": "dropme" },
                { "key": "sort_order", "value": "asc" },
                { "key": "per_page", "value": "5" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Kolom sort di luar whitelist tidak pernah di-interpolasi ke query — fallback ke `created_at` desc, tidak memicu error SQL."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Detail",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Show ({{monitoring_pipeline_id}})",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('punya data + blok tag_number', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('tag_number');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('corrosion_rate');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
